.cljc:12:   r is a self-minted random value, so callers sharing one answers stream\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/remote_pair.cljc:180:                        (assoc policy :dao.stream.remote/request-prefix (str (random-uuid))\nsrc/cljc/dao/space/transactor.cljc:170:   future correct complete-retention transport.\"\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/memory_log.cljc:73:  (atom {:identity (str (random-uuid))\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/memory_log.cljc:172:    ;; Owner close of the logical stream: future availability only.  The\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:315:    (when-not (and (re-matches digit-class body)\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:320:    (when (and (= 10 radix) (str/starts-with? t \"0\") (re-find #\"[1-9]\" t))\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:370:      (and (not (re-find #\"^0[xob]\" lower)) (re-find #\"[.e]\" lower))\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:399:  (when-not (re-matches #\"[0-9a-fA-F]+\" s)\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:436:                (re-matches #\"[0-7]\" e)\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:437:                (let [digits (re-find #\"^[0-7]{1,3}\" (subs body (inc i)))]\nsrc/cljc/yang/python/antlr/lower.cljc:447:  (let [prefix (str/lower-case (re-find #\"^[A-Za-z]*\" text))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/dht.cljc:154:  (and (string? x) (some? (re-matches #\"[0-9a-f]{64}\" x))))\nsrc/cljc/dao/jing/dht.cljc:373:    (let [q (rand-int 2147483647)]\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/jfr_benchmark_analysis.md:84:for argument slicing, and the callee's `zipmap`+`merge` environment extension.\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/jfr_benchmark_analysis.md:185:| `[Ljava.lang.Object;` | 1.82 GB | 23.2% | vector spines for `conj St` + zipmap |\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/jfr_benchmark_analysis.md:187:| `clojure.lang.MapEntry` | 1.08 GB | 13.8% | `zipmap` of closure params |\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/jfr_benchmark_analysis.md:196:zipmap+merge, call → subvec. The two known residual costs are exactly the two\nsrc/cljc/yin/vm/docs/jfr_benchmark_analysis.md:296:6. **Shared, unavoidable remainder**