{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The ABI doctrine permits direct calls for work kept inside the machine. It does not permit new host imports for that work. I also found entropy calls that the reader-conditional census misses, including in `yin.repl`; I’m checking how those omissions affect the migration gates.\n"}}
